        "note_tweet": {
          "entities": {},
          "text": "🚫The Budapest Pride is banned. Viktor Orbán and his far-right allies just voted in the Hungarian Parliament to make any public LGBTQ+ protest illegal. \n\nThis is yet another shameful attack on people’s freedoms, on democracy and the rights of minorities. Far-right politicians like Orbán use the protection of children as an excuse to push their reactionary agenda, and label LGBTIQ+ people as criminals. \n\nThe European Union must speak against this blatant human rights violation, and come strong in defence of equality and diversity. \n\nLGBTIQ+ friends in Hungary, you are not alone!"
        },
